# tools/check-doc-names.py: where the app's old names (Epic Cash Desktop, Epic Cash Mobile, their
# file names and app ids, up to 26.10.24) may stay, and how many lines name them. Everywhere else
# the app is BT Wallet. Each entry has its reason above it.

scan *.md
scan tools/*.py
scan site/src/*
scan site/*.js
versions site/docs/*.md

# WRITING.md's rule on the old names.
WRITING.md 1
# The Overview's one line on the old names, linking Install's section on moving.
site/docs/users/index.md 2
# Install: the section on moving from Epic Cash Desktop or Epic Cash Mobile, and its link.
site/docs/users/install.md 8
# Updates: the old Android app is offered no update; how to move.
site/docs/users/updates.md 2
